Connect a device inventory entry to a brand adapter

Usage:
  olr network add device <id> [flags]

Flags:
      --adapter string        Device adapter: mercury or openwrt
      --address string        HTTP(S) management origin
  -h, --help                  help for device
      --name string           Device display name
      --password-env string   Daemon environment variable containing the management password
      --username string       Management login username

Global Flags:
      --dry-run         show what would change and exit without applying it
  -o, --output string   output format: text|json (default "text")
      --socket string   olrd control socket (default "/run/olr/olrd.sock")
